
# Switch: ONE component for the author, the platform's own control underneath (native-dom-0011, 0013). The build fills
# `{platform}` from its env chain: macOS, iOS and Android reach ./native/toolkit/switch.tree (NSSwitch, UISwitch,
# android.widget.Switch) through their `toolkit` rung, and every other target, the web among them, falls to the
# generic ./native/switch.tree. Both take `host`, `class` and `control`. See note/term/app/11-uniform-interface.md.

bear @term/face/component/native/{platform}/switch
